# ETI test files (large binary files)
*.eti
*.raw
test_data/streams/
samples/large/

# Large ETI test data directories. The captures are World DAB licensed
# test material and NEVER published (they only make the PRIVATE test suite
# work locally). The small Bangkok fixture (30 MB) and the *.txt description
# files are TRACKED in the private repo so the private suite is self-contained.
eti/BayerischerRundfunk-Warntag2024-2024-09-12/
eti/EWSv1_1/
eti/HessischerRundfunk-Warntag2024-2024-09-12_journalline/
